# Ghostty commit shared by the native worker and frontend WASM builds.
#
# Keep both runtimes on this single source revision. Target-specific patches may
# expose different embedding APIs, but terminal parsing and storage come from
# this exact commit on every supported platform.
#
# The frontend no longer builds its module: it mirrors ghostty-org's own
# prebuilt ghostty-vt.wasm, which exists only for the commit their rolling "tip"
# release was last built from. Moving this pin therefore means moving it to that
# commit and re-mirroring in the same sitting (make publish-ghostty-vt-wasm),
# then republishing the native archives for it (make publish-native-vt).
#
# Verified for native darwin/arm64 + linux/amd64 + linux/arm64 and frontend
# wasm32-freestanding at d760ee9 (2026-08-15). Never float this commit.
d760ee96e54657416eb427b793c7e839f003df7d
